###  http://www.semanticweb.org/lennart/ontologies/2026/4/WISDOM-Stress/SocioEvaluativePhase
<http://www.semanticweb.org/lennart/ontologies/2026/4/WISDOM-Stress/SocioEvaluativePhase> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/lennart/ontologies/2026/4/WISDOM-Stress/Activity> ,
                                                                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                                            owl:onProperty <http://www.semanticweb.org/lennart/ontologies/2026/4/WISDOM-Stress/hasAssociatedStressor> ;
                                                                                                            owl:someValuesFrom <http://www.semanticweb.org/lennart/ontologies/2026/4/WISDOM-Stress/SocioEvaluativeStressor>
                                                                                                          ] ;
                                                                                          rdfs:comment "A phase labeled as socio-evaluative stress."@en ;
                                                                                          rdfs:label "Socio-Evaluative Stress Phase"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/lennart/ontologies/2026/4/WISDOM-Stress/SocioEvaluativeStressor
